msgstr "https://github.com/drilonsaiti/dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24"

#. Description of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid ""
"Show a car dealer's AutoScout24 stock on their own WordPress site: synced "
"locally, fast, crawlable and fully styleable."
msgstr ""
"Mostra lo stock AutoScout24 di un concessionario sul proprio sito WordPress:"
" sincronizzato in locale, veloce, indicizzabile e completamente "
"personalizzabile."

#. Author of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "Drilon Saiti"
msgstr "Drilon Saiti"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "https://drilonsaiti.github.io/"
msgstr "https://drilonsaiti.github.io/"

#: includes/class-admin.php:58
msgid ""
"Our vehicle listings are provided by AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace "
"Group AG). Vehicle photos are loaded directly from the AutoScout24 image "
"server (images.autoscout24.ch); your browser therefore sends your IP address"
" and browser information to that server. Links to vehicles lead to "
"autoscout24.ch."
msgstr ""
"I nostri annunci di veicoli provengono da AutoScout24 (SMG Swiss Marketplace"
" Group AG). Le foto vengono caricate direttamente dal server di immagini di "
"AutoScout24 (images.autoscout24.ch); il tuo browser invia quindi a quel "
"server il tuo indirizzo IP e informazioni sul browser. I link ai veicoli "
"portano a autoscout24.ch."

